.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Following the first dilute-gas Bose-Einstein condensates in 1995 (Cornell, Wieman, Ketterle), experimentalists set condensates rotating and watched them nucleate quantized vortices above a critical rotation frequency, arranging themselves into a triangular Abrikosov-like lattice -- exactly as Gross-Pitaevskii theory, by then over three decades old, had predicted. Both the vortex-free and single-vortex states compared here are relaxed (at zero rotation) via imaginary-time propagation of the Gross-Pitaevskii equation for a harmonically trapped condensate,">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/fields/quantum_fields/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_bec_vortex_lattice_nucleation_thumb.png
    :alt:

  :doc:`/api/gallery/fields/quantum_fields/plot_bec_vortex_lattice_nucleation`

.. raw:: html

      <div class="sphx-glr-thumbnail-title">The critical rotation frequency for BEC vortex nucleation</div>
    </div>


.. only:: not html

 * :doc:`/api/gallery/fields/quantum_fields/plot_bec_vortex_lattice_nucleation`

.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Eugene Gross and Lev Pitaevskii independently derived, in 1961, a mean-field equation for the macroscopic wavefunction of a dilute Bose-Einstein condensate: a nonlinear Schrodinger equation with a cubic self-interaction term, i\hbar\partial_t\psi = [-\tfrac{\hbar^2}{2m}\nabla^2 + V + g|\psi|^2]\psi. Decades before a real BEC existed in a laboratory, this gave theorists a concrete tool for its structure. In the natural units used here (\hbar=m=1) for a condensate held in a 2D harmonic trap V(\mathbf{r})=\tfrac12(x^2+y^2),">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/fields/quantum_fields/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_gpe_ground_state_relaxation_thumb.png
    :alt:

  :doc:`/api/gallery/fields/quantum_fields/plot_gpe_ground_state_relaxation`

.. raw:: html

      <div class="sphx-glr-thumbnail-title">Relaxing to the Gross-Pitaevskii interacting ground state</div>
    </div>


.. only:: not html

 * :doc:`/api/gallery/fields/quantum_fields/plot_gpe_ground_state_relaxation`

